{"version":1,"content":"<p>由鄭保瑞監製，MIRROR隊長楊樂文（Lokman）、談善言、邵美琪主演，艾威、陳紫萱、劉皓嵐及蘇文濤演出，陳湛文特別演出的電影《被殺的那天》，正式入選第31屆釜山國際電影節「展望‧亞洲」競賽單元，前日（10日）在韓國釜山舉行世界首映。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T12:19:06.487238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:30:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:57:41.038842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:17:40.248794+00:00","content_hash":"e9262e1d26b565bbcd46483e05a496e831dad5369f2659d0322f0cc65a614bc1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}